# (declined); its finish with option 1 sets Status 1, and the next tick sets the char down at -700.042 0.399 -441.301
# rot 192 in the Walk of Echoes. The login at Status 1 plays the zone-in 4; its finish sets Status 2 (the warp that
# gives the flow its zone plays nothing at Status 2). The Ornate Door (_521) plays 5; its finish sets Status 3. Status 4
# (a GM, for the fight no battlefield file holds): the rezone plays 6; the update with option 6 sends 05C [1, 300, 200,
# 100, 182, 1]; the finish sets Status 5, and the next tick sets the char down at -700.063 -17.6 -331.903 rot 64. The
# login plays 7; the update with option 5 sends 05C [1, 300, 200, 100, 73, 545, 278]; the finish sets Status 6 (the next
# tick: the 00B zone-out only, the same spot). The login plays 8; the update with option 5 sends 05C [1, 300, 200, 100];
# the finish sets Status 7 (the same). The login plays 9; its finish completes the mission (key item 1732, the Moonshade
# Earring, message 6398; Where It All Began current).
